# U39: section collapse (CalcSectionControl.lua:50-64, the toggle buttons; UpdateSize with
# collapsed subsections; the column packing after a section shrinks to its header): collapse
# "View Skill Details" (the sections below move up), then "Skill Hit Damage" and "Life", then
# expand "View Skill Details" again. The collapsed states are the model's subsection tables, so
# the Calcs section of each snapshot (T4) carries them.
#! u39-expect-calcs collapsed="true" id="HitDamage"
#! u39-expect-calcs collapsed="true" id="SkillSelect"
fixture userdir=../../fixtures/user1
frames 2
load-build "Builds/allflame_exp_001.xml"
frames 2
key-down CTRL
press 4
key-up CTRL
frames 3
# View Skill Details "-"
move 1010 72
frames 1
click LEFTBUTTON
frames 3
snapshot skill_select
# Skill Hit Damage moved up to y = 62 + 22 + 8 = 92: its toggle is at y 95
move 1010 102
frames 1
click LEFTBUTTON
frames 2
# Life (column 4)
move 1248 212
click LEFTBUTTON
frames 3
snapshot three
# expand View Skill Details again
move 1010 72
click LEFTBUTTON
frames 2
move 1270 790
frames 2
snapshot expanded
